{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_wscoot_set_1_story_1","storyGroup":"story_wscoot_set_1","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"只待天明","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"骋风想带着抚养自己长大的山贼们金盆洗手，开展镖局生意，山贼们却因此争斗分家。新镖局的第一趟镖便遭遇了劫镖，来者正是旧识。","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_wscoot_1_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["骋风","德叔","？？？","文姨","愉快的帮众","冷静观察的帮众","目瞪口呆的众人","童年阿诚","愤怒的帮众"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.15","fadetime":"0.01","id":4},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.15","fadetime":"0.01","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_bg_bg_coldforest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_driveincar","loop":"true","channel":"1","volume":"0.3","id":9},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":11},{"type":"text","text":"炎国尚蜀的山道上，一辆镖车横冲直撞地行驶着。渐渐入夜，深山静谧无人，只有赶路镖车野蛮的引擎声。","id":12},{"type":"dialog","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$3","duration":"1","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_005","duration":"1","id":15},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#7$3","focus":"l","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"德叔，你的酒？！","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"r","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"怎么，你也要来两口？省着点喝，山路长着呢。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#7$3","focus":"l","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"我出发前特地给你藏起来的。按规矩走镖不能……","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"r","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"规矩？哈哈。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$3","focus":"l","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"……德叔想说什么？请明说。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"r","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"刚才在寨子里不讲，是不想下了你的面子。你一声不吭跑出去好几年，突然回了寨子，叫大家别再抢东西，要什么洗白开镖局。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"为了你这一句话，大家打得头破血流。多少年的寨子，说分家就分家。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#2$3","focus":"l","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"我也没想到，文姨会反对得这么坚决，就这样带着大家走了……但我更没有想到，有一半人愿意留下来一起干镖局生意。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-2$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"r","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"我们留下来，是为了让你给大家啰哩啰嗦立那么多规矩的吗？弄得大家伙儿多不自在！","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"德叔告诉你，我们驰骋江湖那么多年，从来都只认一条规矩——谁的拳头硬谁说了算。大家说，是不是？","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"none","id":36},{"type":"text","text":"这些前几天还是山贼的、面目凶狠的镖师有的点头应和，有的不吱声，只是阴沉沉地观察着情势。","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$3","focus":"l","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"……德叔，你为什么选择留下来？","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"r","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"好啊，现在准备赶人了？","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#7$3","focus":"l","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"不……我不希望寨子闹成现在这样。只是事到如今，大家就算想回到义帮，以文姨的脾气，也不会再接受了吧。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"r","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"你小子……","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#2$3","focus":"l","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"既然大家都只剩一条出路，更应该好好谈谈。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-2$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"我想大家和我想的应该差不多，如果镖局的生意真的能成，那以后就可以过上相对安稳的日子。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-2$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"r","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"嘁，哪有你说得这么容易。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#2$3","focus":"l","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"是，我们最不容易的，其实是摒弃过去。一个镖局的第一趟镖有多重要，德叔你是知道的。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-2$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"r","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"……哼。之前吴金彪那厮在江湖上得罪了人，他的镖局开门的时候被仇人劫了镖，闹得人尽皆知，后来……那镖局就垮了。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#2$3","focus":"l","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"曾经的山贼开的镖局本来就引人注目，好不容易等来这第一趟镖，那些道上的“老相识”都等着看我们的笑话。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-2$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"那意味着一旦失镖，我们在江湖上将信誉全无……我们的镖局，大家想要的新生活，就都完了。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-2$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"义帮过去也没少得罪人。前方一整条山道素来荒无人烟，我们再小心也不为过。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-2$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"r","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"唉，烦死了！你小子跑了几年江湖就得意忘形了啊？还是小时候可爱！","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":61},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","id":62},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"all","id":63},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":64},{"type":"playsound","key":"$drift","channel":"2","volume":"1","id":65},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":66},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"2","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"r","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"*炎国粗口*！什么情况？！","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#6$3","focus":"l","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"停车！","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-6$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#6$3","focus":"all","id":73},{"type":"playsound","key":"$drift","volume":"1","id":74},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":75},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#8$3","focus":"l","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"大家先别开车门。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":78},{"type":"charslot","id":79},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.5","channel":"1","id":80},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":81},{"type":"text","text":"几双眼睛透过车窗观察着四周的山林，确认没有埋伏后，他们方才打开了车门。","id":82},{"type":"dialog","id":83},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cardoorc","volume":"1","id":84},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.15","fillto":"0","fadetime":"2","id":85},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.15","fillto":"0","fadetime":"2","id":86},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":87},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":88,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$3","focus":"r","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"r","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"*炎国粗口*！爆了俩胎！","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#8$3","focus":"l","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"这么大一片碎玻璃藏在树叶底下……这里是飞羽帮的地盘，照理说，我们的买路钱给足了，不应该再刁难我们。","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"是临时加价？还是有人闯进了他们的地盘，找我们的麻烦……","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$3","focus":"l","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"总之，最好快点离开这里。我来联络最近的修车店……","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"r","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"别想了，深山老林的没信号。埋伏人他们老练得很，就是要你叫天天不应，叫地地不灵。派人去求援吧。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$3","focus":"l","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"不，我们现在绝对不能分散，分散就中了敌人的招。既然走不了，就耗着吧。对面恐怕也不想等一整晚。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":101},{"type":"charslot","id":102},{"type":"text","text":"他说完，抱着胳膊靠在车上，目光紧盯着林子深处没入黑暗的方向。","id":103},{"type":"dialog","id":104},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_soldiersrun","volume":"1","id":105},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":106},{"type":"text","text":"不过多久，窸窣几声，从黑暗中走出了一大群面目凶狠的家伙，围成一圈挡住了他们的去路。对方都佩着与镖师们类似的环首刀。","id":107},{"type":"text","text":"领头的中年女性做了个“动手”的手势，所有匪徒都拔出了刀来，明晃晃地对着他们。","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你也不笨嘛。","id":109},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#8$3","focus":"r","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"r","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"……唉，我就知道。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#8$3","focus":"l","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"……文姨。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":116},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":117},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":118},{"type":"charslot","id":119},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","amount":"0.8","block":"true","id":120},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_bg_bg_ibindoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":121},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":122},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.3","id":123,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":124},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":125},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#1$3","duration":"1.5","id":127},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"文姨！大家！我回来了。","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"……啧。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"是我……阿诚。你认不出来了？","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"你走的时候还是个软软白白的小孩，回来怎么就跟那帮臭烘烘的老爷们儿差不多了。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#2$3","focus":"m","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"我……！","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-2$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_798_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愉快的帮众","text":"哈哈哈！阿文，你就别假装嫌弃他了。这些年你为了读懂他寄回来的信，字都识了不少呢。不是还特地留了一头瘤兽准备炖给他？","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_npc_798_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"少啰嗦，擅自脱离帮派，坏了规矩，就得挨罚。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"看在你知道自己回来，先不动刀。去向历代帮主认错。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_798_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愉快的帮众","text":"要不算了吧？他才刚回来……回来了就好啊。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_npc_798_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"去。","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#9$3","focus":"m","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"好。思过多久？","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-9$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"少油嘴滑舌。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$3","focus":"m","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"唔。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"义帮的历代老帮主们，当年叔叔阿姨送我去学堂读书，我却因为打架被开除了，又觉得愧对他们……就没敢回来。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"这些年虽然一直很想念大家，但总觉得，得混出点名堂才有脸回寨子。就这么浑浑噩噩，一直在外头待了那么多年。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#2$3","focus":"m","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"但我真心希望，这次回来能帮上大家的忙，报答大家的养育之恩，也希望能让大家的日子变得越来越好。所以……别生气了啊。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-2$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#2$3","focus":"none","id":157},{"type":"text","text":"骋风虽对着老帮主们的牌位站着，说到此处时，脸却早已扭过来，一脸恳求地望着文姨。","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"（叹气）","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"这次突然回来，是为了什么？","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#9$3","focus":"m","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"回来帮忙。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-9$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"帮什么忙？","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#9$3","focus":"m","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"大家的新事业啊。别看我这样，这几年我可是各行各业都待过，镖师我也当过。我们的镖局刚开业，需要帮什么忙，我都能干。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-9$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"谁跟你说我们要开镖局？","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"呃……江湖八卦小报？是我误会了吗？","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_798_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愉快的帮众","text":"阿文，那事儿，你没告诉他……？","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_npc_798_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"住口。","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$3","focus":"m","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"……什么事？","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"……你没必要知道。我先忙着，你反思完自己过来吃晚饭。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":180},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":181},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":182},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":183},{"type":"charslot","id":184},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_bg_bg_ibindoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":185},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":186},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":187},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_798_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愉快的帮众","text":"所以，你听说的“开镖局”其实就是这么回事儿。这事儿有点敏感，你千万别追着帮主问，尤其别当着大家的面问……","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_npc_798_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"怎么会这样，我们放出去的镖局广告……都是假的？只是为了骗别人的货……那就算这一次成了，以后怎么办？","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_798_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愉快的帮众","text":"有什么办法，现在风头紧，大家的日子都不好过，先把眼前的难关渡过去再说。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_npc_798_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_798_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":196},{"type":"multiline","name":"愉快的帮众","text":"你也别一脸正义之士的样子，别说你离开了几年，就不记得我们义帮的老本行了吧？","id":197},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":198},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":199},{"type":"multiline","name":"愉快的帮众","end":"true","text":"哎——你去哪儿？！","id":200},{"type":"dialog","id":201},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":202},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":203},{"type":"charslot","id":204},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_bg_bg_ibindoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":205},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":206},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":207,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":208},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":209},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":210},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$3","duration":"1.5","id":211},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"文姨！我想和你单独聊聊。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"你这就思过完了？","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"行吧。你有什么事，就在这儿说。你人才刚回来，你能感觉到的不满，别人也感觉得到。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":217},{"type":"charslot","id":218},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_140","duration":"1.5","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_305_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":222},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":223},{"type":"text","text":"文姨的话是对着骋风说的，眼睛却看着帮众里那几张不服的面孔。","id":224},{"type":"text","text":"骋风语塞。他敏锐地发现大厅里大家的氛围不对劲。记忆中的寨子总是充满爽朗的欢笑声，可现在，似乎有什么横亘在这些人中间。","id":225},{"type":"dialog","id":226},{"type":"charslot","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$3","focus":"m","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"……文姨，是关于镖局的事，想请你再考虑考虑。","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"我不想让你为难。过去几年我也没和大家一起吃苦，没有资格说三道四。只是，我回寨子的一路上稍作了打听。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"我发现，外面人对于山寨开镖局的事，也不是不能接受。我们正好又接到了一笔生意，是不是能顺势把这笔生意做成呢？","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"哪怕这次挣得少，只要在江湖上有了信誉，以后……","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":234},{"type":"charslot","id":235},{"type":"playsound","key":"$aluminum","volume":"1","id":236},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":237},{"type":"text","text":"砰！文姨一巴掌打翻钱箱，众人哗然，随后，一些一听到这话题就蠢蠢欲动的家伙露出了迟疑的神色——钱箱里只有零星几个银钱。","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"以后？谈以后之前，先帮我把帮里那么多人的肚子喂饱。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"我们都困难成这样了？那院子里那头瘤兽，是特地留到我回来……","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"明白了就闭嘴。何况这件事已经没必要再讨论。","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#4$3","focus":"m","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"我们的人已经动手了？","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-4$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#4$3","focus":"none","id":247},{"type":"text","text":"文姨面无表情地盯着这个由她抚养长大的少年。少年显然不想让她难堪，因而迟疑、退缩，却又有不得不说的话，不得不做的事。","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#8$3","focus":"m","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"文姨，如果我们的老本行已经经营得那么困难，更应该考虑新出路啊。告诉我，他们在哪里？货在哪里？","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"你想怎么样？","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#8$3","focus":"m","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"信誉的建立很难，破坏却在一瞬间。一旦他们劫走了货，大家的后路就彻底断了！我先去把货追回来，剩下的事我们商量着来，行吗？","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"这件事早就有了决断。如果要改变，就把我打趴下。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#8$3","focus":"m","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"文姨！","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":259},{"type":"charslot","id":260},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_unsheathe","channel":"a","volume":"1","id":261},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":262},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_exsheath","channel":"b","volume":"1","id":263},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":264},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_daggerexsheath","channel":"c","volume":"1","id":265},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":266},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_swordexsheath","channel":"d","volume":"1","id":267},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":268},{"type":"text","text":"一瞬间，拔刀声丁零当啷响作一团，骋风还没有反应过来，大厅里几乎所有的帮众都已拔出刀来。","id":269},{"type":"text","text":"有的护住了帮主，有的，却对准了他们的帮主。","id":270},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"住手！都冷静！","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静观察的帮众","text":"我很冷静。小子，你先说说，把货追回来以后，你准备怎么做。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"（犹豫地望向文姨）","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$3","focus":"m","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"好，那我就当，这是个给我说话的机会。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"把货追回来以后，照常给收货人送过去，先完成这一单。","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"然后开一个门店，接单、建档、路线规划……这一套流程我都会一点。","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静观察的帮众","text":"门店和设备的钱呢？","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$3","focus":"m","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"我这些年稍存了一些，如果叔叔阿姨们愿意再支援一点……","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静观察的帮众","text":"行，你懂怎么弄就行。继续说，能成吗？","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#2$3","focus":"m","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"不能保证，血本无归的例子很多，也比现在辛苦得多，挣钱也慢。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-2$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$3","focus":"m","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"更需要大家完全改掉在寨子里的习惯，不要用暴力去解决问题，也就是说，尽量少打打杀杀。否则，我们很难走下去。","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"呵。这些人是谁，我比你更清楚。你在把他们送上不归路。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静观察的帮众","text":"得来太容易的反而不可信。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静观察的帮众","text":"行，阿诚，我来告诉你那批货在哪里，你负责帮我们找一条新出路。","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静观察的帮众","text":"至于阻挠你的人，你不用担心。","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":297},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":298},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":299},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":300},{"type":"charslot","id":301},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","amount":"0","block":"true","id":302},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_bg_bg_coldforest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":303},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":304},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":305,"musicid":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":306},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":307},{"type":"text","text":"当骋风最终将夺回的那批货送到收货人手中，再回到义帮时，整个寨子已是一片狼藉。","id":308},{"type":"text","text":"文姨带着一半的人离开了。留下来的大家把杀到一半的瘤兽炖了。坐在被砸得一塌糊涂的寨子里，没人有胃口吃肉。","id":309},{"type":"text","text":"此时此刻，是那场争斗后，分裂的两帮人第一次见面。","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"文姨……大家的伤势如何？我听说那天打得很厉害……","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"……","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$3","focus":"m","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"……你能放我们过去吗？","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"呵，我们特地等在这里，就为了听你说这句话？","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"我们义帮是做什么的，你也不是不清楚。我们怎么对不守规矩的人，也不用我提醒你。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#8$3","focus":"m","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"我不会对你动刀的，也不能把货交给你。只是想请你看在大家多年的情分上，让一条路。","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"这是我们正式开业后的第一趟镖，我们敲锣打鼓，请了所有能请到的人。如果失镖，大家就一无所有了。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"既然你信誓旦旦为大家谋出路，那就从我们中间穿过去，这点小困难都解决不了吗？","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":325},{"type":"charslot","id":326},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_exsheath","volume":"1","id":327},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":328},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"m","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"穿就穿！谁怕谁！我看你就是想弄死我们！自己走不出来，也不让别人走新路子吗！谁挡道，就砍了谁！","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":331},{"type":"charslot","id":332},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":333},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“砍了！砍了！”余下的镖师也激愤地喊起来，拦路的山贼们于是与他们开始对骂，作势要上来砍人。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":334},{"type":"subtitle","text":"骋风挡在他们中间，嗓子都喊哑了。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":335},{"type":"subtitle","text":"又是这样的局面。一言不合，两方拔刀相向。混乱中骋风看见文姨似乎露出一丝笑容。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":336},{"type":"subtitle","text":"她看看骋风，目光在说：“你看，我说的吧。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":337},{"type":"subtitle","id":338},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#8$3","focus":"m","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"……！","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$3","focus":"m","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"德叔，冷静。","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"m","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"*炎国粗口*！老子今天就让对面看看——","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$3","focus":"m","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"得罪了。","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":348},{"type":"charslot","id":349},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":350},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_decap","volume":"1","id":351},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":352},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"m","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"唔唔唔！臭小子，你干嘛！你疯啦，把酒浇在我头上！好*炎国粗口*冷啊！","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":355},{"type":"charslot","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"目瞪口呆的众人","text":"……","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$3","focus":"m","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"好，都安静了，请听我说几句。","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"我们从来不靠说话解决问题。","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#3$3","focus":"m","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"现在和以前不同了。至少大家想要的和以前不一样。","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-3$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$3","focus":"m","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"不，以前的大家也……","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":366},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":367},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":368},{"type":"charslot","id":369},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","amount":"0.8","block":"true","id":370},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_bg_25_g02_yanalley_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":371},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":372},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$distressed_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_distressed_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":373,"musicid":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":374},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":375},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"m","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"小子，明天开始可以去读书了。你要是不好好读，你文姨、德叔、吴大娘、肥舅爷一人暴揍你一顿。","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"none","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"童年阿诚","text":"……我不要读。","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"m","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"你再说一遍？！","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"none","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"童年阿诚","text":"……你们干嘛要那样低声下气地求老师。德叔你不是说过，谁拳头硬谁说了算，难道老师的拳头比你硬？哎哟！你打我干嘛！","id":383},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"m","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"你小子，刚才那话可别让你文姨听见。","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"none","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"童年阿诚","text":"文姨她、她明明从来不对人低头的……","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"童年阿诚","text":"而且我听见他们说……","id":388},{"type":"dialog","id":389},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":390},{"type":"subtitle","text":"鼷兽的儿子会打洞。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":391},{"type":"subtitle","id":392},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"童年阿诚","text":"算了，没什么。总之，我不想去。我要跟你们一样挺胸抬头——哎哟！你你你……放开我的耳朵！","id":394},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"m","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"小子，给我记住，干我们这行，总有被揍趴下的时候。想一直抬着头活着，就给我从这个寨子里走出去！","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"你知道寨子里有多少人是想走也走不了的吗？被人骗走了土地一无所有的、替人出头却被害了全家性命的……都只能倚靠你文姨的庇护。","id":397,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"可你不一样，你还有希望。","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"none","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"童年阿诚","text":"那你呢？你什么时候走出去？","id":400},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"m","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"……","id":402,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":403},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":404},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":405},{"type":"charslot","id":406},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","amount":"0","block":"true","id":407},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_bg_bg_coldforest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":408},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":409},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":410},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":411},{"type":"text","text":"德叔当时怎么回答的来着，骋风记不清了。无非是像往常一样，扯了个不正经的玩笑。","id":412},{"type":"text","text":"但这一次，德叔毫不犹豫地走到了他这边。于是他明白了，从来不是不想，而是不知该如何。","id":413},{"type":"text","text":"道行不行得通，总得先有人走走看的。","id":414},{"type":"text","text":"骋风下定了决心，手慢慢伸向腰侧。文姨看着他的刀，手下们看着他的刀。这个距离，一旦抽刀，就是生与死的交锋。","id":415},{"type":"text","text":"手指触到腰侧，文姨猛地握紧了刀柄，而骋风却从口袋里掏出了一沓钱，夹在两指间，递到了文姨的面前，故作江湖人的老练。","id":416},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"……","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#2$3","focus":"m","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"文姨，德叔，我是你们捡来的，你们却像对自己的小孩一样对我，还特地送我去读书。","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-2$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"你们当时为我考虑的事，正是现在我为大家考虑的事。","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-2$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$3","focus":"m","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"有的人可能很难走出寨子，但也有人可以先替他们探探路。能不能成，走了才知道，就让我们试试看吧，文姨。","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"所以，现在，正式地……","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#2$3","focus":"m","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"我们义字镖局，想和你们义帮交个朋友。从此吃朋友的饭，穿朋友的衣，也望朋友行个方便。","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-2$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"……","id":428,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_140","focus":"m","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的帮众","text":"你小子以为给点钱恩怨就能一笔勾销吗！","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_140-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$3","focus":"m","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"不，我知道不守规矩要挨罚。但是，我引出的乱子，就让我一个人流血吧。那之后，请作为义帮，接受义字镖局的……小心意。","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":433},{"type":"charslot","id":434},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","channel":"1","id":435},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":436},{"type":"text","text":"骋风说着，伸出了另一条胳膊。","id":437},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"m","id":438},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"喂！","id":439,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$3","focus":"m","id":440},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"（摇头示意德叔不要上前）","id":441,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#3$3","focus":"m","id":442},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"文帮主，请。","id":443,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-3$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"好，好。好一个你们，我们。","id":445,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"好！","id":446,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":447},{"type":"charslot","id":448},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":449},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":450},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch","id":451},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":452},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":453},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"呃！","id":455,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":456},{"type":"charslot","id":457},{"type":"text","text":"刀并没有如预想那般向胳膊落下，而是连着刀鞘狠狠地砸在了骋风的额头上，顿时血流如注。","id":458},{"type":"text","text":"而后，那把刀“当啷”一声落地，文姨却没有捡起它的意思。","id":459},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1641_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","focus":"m","id":460},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文姨","text":"你我从此恩断义绝，一刀两断！撤。","id":461,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1641_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":462},{"type":"charslot","id":463},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_soldiersrun","volume":"1","id":464},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":465},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"m","id":466},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"喂，脑子没事吧？那一下是真打啊……","id":467,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"他们，还真走了。","id":468,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#2$3","focus":"m","id":469},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"……","id":470,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-2$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":471},{"type":"charslot","id":472},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","channel":"1","id":473},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":474},{"type":"text","text":"骋风捡起文姨的刀，擦擦沾上的土，与自己的刀佩在一起。","id":475},{"type":"dialog","id":476},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$2","duration":"1","id":477},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_005","duration":"1","id":478},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":479},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$2","focus":"l","id":480},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"幸好，她下手到底还是留了情的……我感觉，总有一天，这把刀我是能还回去的。","id":481,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#7$2","focus":"l","id":482},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"嘶——疼疼疼，德叔你是要给我止血，不是给我扩大伤口吧！","id":483,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$2","focus":"l","id":484},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"啊……","id":485,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"r","id":486},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"怎么了？","id":487,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":488},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"all","id":489},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_bg_bg_forest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":490},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#10$2","focus":"l","id":491},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"闹了那么久，天都亮了。","id":492,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":493},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"走吧，出发吧。把我们的第一趟镖送到。","id":494,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_005","focus":"r","id":495},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德叔","text":"得先把轮胎修好，笨小子。","id":496,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_445_wscoot_1#5$2","focus":"l","id":497},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骋风","text":"啊哈，差点忘了。","id":498,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_445_wscoot_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":499},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":500},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":501},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":502},{"type":"image","id":503},{"type":"charslot","id":504}],"characters":["骋风","德叔","？？？","文姨","愉快的帮众","冷静观察的帮众","目瞪口呆的众人","童年阿诚","愤怒的帮众"]}